Package: osmoments
Type: Package
Title: Exact Moments of Order Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-16
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zheyang", "Wu", email = "zheyangwu@wpi.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Computes the exact means, variances and covariances of the order
    statistics of a continuous distribution, at any ranks and any sample size, by
    numerical evaluation of the defining integrals, with closed-form results where
    the distribution has them. Five families are built in (normal, uniform,
    exponential, logistic and Gumbel) and any other continuous distribution
    enters through its distribution, density and quantile functions. It also
    computes the moments of linear combinations of order statistics and of sample
    quantiles (under the nine definitions of R's quantile() function), and Lloyd's
    best linear unbiased estimators of location and scale from any subset of
    ranks. The computation and its verification are described by Wu and Tong
    (2026) in 'osmoments: Exact Means, Variances and Covariances of Order
    Statistics in R' (manuscript).
URL: https://zwulab.github.io/osmoments/, https://github.com/ZWuLab/osmoments
